{"availability":"available","full":"tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf","name":"tc-lib-pdf","description":"PHP PDF Library (TCPDF)","category":"Other","language":"PHP","stars":1914,"forks":262,"created":"2016-06-10T17:23:19Z","updated":"2026-10-03T12:44:24Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://tcpdf.org/","topics":["pdf","pdf-generation","php","tcpdf"],"demo":null,"color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","stars":1914,"forks":262}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The next generation of TCPDF - a modern, modular PHP library for programmatically generating PDF documents.","💖 Keep TCPDF maintained. tc-lib-pdf is the actively-developed successor to TCPDF, which is installed 100M+ times across 500+ PHP packages and is now maintenance-only. If your company depends on it, become a sponsor to keep this shared infrastructure secure and maintained. See Sponsors for tiers.","tc-lib-pdf is a pure-PHP library for generating PDF documents. It is the modern evolution of TCPDF, built around a modular package architecture, a Composer-first workflow, and strict PHP types."],"features":["Pure PHP. No external binaries, headless browsers, or shell calls in the rendering pipeline. Only gd and zlib are optional extensions.","Archival, print, and accessibility conformance in one library. PDF/A (1/2/3, a/b/u), PDF/X (1a, 3, 4, 5), and PDF/UA (1, 2) are built in, under the LGPL.","Signing up to PAdES B-LTA. Detached CMS and PAdES B-B/B-T/B-LT/B-LTA, with RFC 3161 timestamps, embedded revocation evidence, and support for both local keys and remote HSM signing.","Reproducible output. Pinning the dates and file identifier renders byte-identical documents on every run of the same installation, so builds are diffable and verifiable.","Modular and strictly typed. Each concern is a separate Composer package with declared types, so upgrades and dependencies stay scoped."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f39a96a8673b65a75ed6def4200d11550b25ecce74f80fba4d94edf849d1442f","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"The next generation of TCPDF - a modern, modular PHP library for programmatically generating PDF documents.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f39a96a8673b65a75ed6def4200d11550b25ecce74f80fba4d94edf849d1442f","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-03T12:44:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tecnickcom/tc-lib-pdf/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:13:48.094Z","hash":"f39a96a8673b65a75ed6def4200d11550b25ecce74f80fba4d94edf849d1442f","originalBytes":15396,"storedBytes":15396,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pdf","doc","examples","page","fonts","tcpdf","digital","php","file","fonts.md","html","import","pades","see","tc-lib-pdf","conformance","document","font","pdf-","remote","run","signatures","text","timestamps","via","every","external","installation","ltv","rendering","signing","single","companion","composer","configurable","embedded","encryption","full","graphics","icc","images","index.md","keep","license","make","pages","path","security","signature","signatures.md","sponsors","standards.md","them","transparency","before","cms","content","contributing","control","custom","directory","documents","embedding","emits","features","generated","generation","including","jpeg","keys","library","local","logo","modular","optional","overview","package","packages","png","profiles","projec